      'The Rose Court Side wraps three sides of the courtyard, and each side has its own run of room numbers. The first digit is the floor and the last three fix the position, so 9103 and 3103 are the same window seven floors apart. Select any window to see its room type.',
    categories: {
      superior: 'Superior Room',
      alcove: 'Superior Alcove Room',
